WEBVTT

00:05:29.797 --> 00:05:33.897
if humans truly put their mind,
their muscle, their money behind it.

00:05:34.297 --> 00:05:38.397
But, for the sake of this argument,
let's stick to these costs,

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:39.563
plus 50 percent.

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:44.497
In the case of our European midsize sedan,
this translates into ...

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:45.663
wait for it ...

00:05:46.263 --> 00:05:47.397
200 euros.

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:50.530
Wait, that can't be right.

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:53.497
That's not even a percent
of the final sales value.

00:05:53.530 --> 00:05:55.130
Well, let's do the math.

00:05:55.563 --> 00:05:59.297
If you spend 30,000 euros for a car,
what are you actually paying for?

00:05:59.897 --> 00:06:02.897
Well, first of all, the car company
needs to make money.